===Etymology 2===
{{zh-forms}}

Based on a commentary to the following passage from the ''{{w|Kao Gong Ji}}'' in the ''{{w|Rites of Zhou}}'' by the Eastern Han scholar {{w|Zheng Xuan}} ({{lang|zh|鄭玄}}, 127–200): {{lang|zh|「[[弓]][[而]]'''羽'''[[閷]]，[[末]][[應]][[將]][[發]]。」}} The Tang-era scholar {{w|賈公彥|Jia Gongyan|lang=zh}} ({{lang|zh|賈公彥}}) considers Zheng's reading as {{zh-m|破讀|gloss=isolated instance of unusual pronunciation}}. The textual quality of the passage, along with the meaning of the Zheng–Jia commentaries, has been called into question.<ref>{{cite-book|zh|title=zh:周禮疑義舉要|author=zh:江永|year=1791|text={{lang|zh|「下柎之弓」節…未知其所以然，不敢強解。}}|section={{lang|zh|冬官考工記}}|sectionurl=https://ctext.org/library.pl?if=en&file=86817&page=201}}</ref><ref>{{cite-book|zh|title=zh:周禮正義|author=zh:孫詒讓|authorlink=Sun Yirang|year=1899|section={{lang|zh|冬官考工記}}|publisher=zh:楚學社|sectionurl=https://archive.org/details/02073702.cn/page/n96/mode/1up|text={{lang|zh|{{w|Duan Yucai|段玉裁}}云「此易其字」。案經典「扈」無「緩」訓，未詳所出。}}}}</ref>

